What:		/sys/touchpanel/double_tap
Date:		November 2026
Contact:	Linux input mailing list <linux-input@vger.kernel.org>
Description:
		Enable (1) or disable (0) double-tap-to-wake. Defaults to 0.
		The value is latched at the next panel blank or system suspend.
		Gesture mode retains panel bias/reset and reports KEY_WAKEUP for
		Novatek double-click packets. Other gestures are ignored.
		The SPI device's power/wakeup must also be enabled.
		This is the interface used by the cannon Lineage power HAL.
